Subject: [PATCH 5/8] kbuild: teach mkmakfile to be silent
Date: Mon, 24 Nov 2008 21:54:52 +0100
Message-Id: <1227560095-32597-5-git-send-email-sam@ravnborg.org>
In-Reply-To: <20081124205150.GA32497@uranus.ravnborg.org>
